OL,5,G0000 Shetland
OL,6,     FCalder initially reels from the
OL,7,     Fawful news, but quickly becomes
OL,8,     Fsuspicious. Tosh worries Harry and
OL,9,     FDonnie with her pursuit of a
OL,10,     Fcontroversial new theory.
OL,11,G0110 The Bay
OL,12,     FIt is the day of Saif's funeral,
OL,13,     Fand as Jenn watches closely for
OL,14,     Fany suspicious behaviour,
OL,15,     Fdivisions within the Rahman
OL,16,     Fhousehold widen.
OL,17,G0210 The Bay
OL,18,     FShazia's explosive revelation
OL,19,     Fthreatens to destroy the Rahman
OL,20,     Ffamily. The police investigation
OL,21,     Fgrinds to a halt until a vital
OL,22,     Fclue offers a glimmer of hope.
